{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Play the free demo</strong> \u2014 a short and funny phone-sim adventure in 9 languages!<br>Make calls, chat with friends, and order food through the cracks of a broken screen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh no! Dropped your phone again? \ud83d\udca5</strong><br><i>Nice job. \ud83d\udc4d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But how far can you go?</strong><br><i>Before you finally give up.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Smashing My Phone\u2122</strong> is a <i>story-driven campus comedy</i> where using everyday apps becomes a small disaster you have to outsmart.<br>Friendship, team projects, and romance\u2014handled through apps that don\u2019t care about your broken screen.<br>So you improvise, retry, and make it work, because freshman year wasn\u2019t chaotic enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use everyday apps, even with half the screen dead.<br>\u2022 Tap around dead zones. Unlock PIN screens. Solve phone-style puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end, become a true <strong>Modern Survivalist</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t just a game.</strong><br><i>This is our life. \u2601\ufe0f</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/a2bf1b384bf9f1c53e0bd65cc55241c4.webp?t=1769064672\" width=1560 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smashing My Phone\u2122</strong> is a <strong>phone-sim puzzle adventure</strong> about <strong>surviving another day with a shattered screen.</strong><br>Use a smartphone filled with everyday apps and find clever ways to complete your daily tasks <strong>despite the cracks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Phone-sim puzzles:</strong> Operate familiar apps like <strong>calls, chats, food delivery, and banking</strong> to handle the small yet chaotic routines of everyday life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Cracked-screen challenges:</strong> Some parts of the screen <strong>don\u2019t respond\u2014find your own ways to work around the damage.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude05 <strong>Light humor:</strong> Enjoy <strong>small jokes and relatable moments</strong> across messages, notifications, and daily apps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story bits:</strong> Follow a <strong>college freshman</strong> clinging to his cracked phone, surviving modern life <strong>one swipe at a time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.poster.avif?t=1769064672\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.webm?t=1769064672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4080590/extras/e70da474d52c2b5a0fe71fe113d0d219.mp4?t=1769064672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"May the phone be with you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4080590/49893d7c41c013c3487dd290e9dada714a2f8afb.jpg"},{"name":"Breaking Bad\u2026ly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4080590/49893d7c41c013c3487dd290e9dada714a2f8afb.jpg"},{"name":"A Day After Crack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4080590/49893d7c41c013c3487dd290e9dada714a2f8afb.jpg"},{"name":"The Ring\u2026tone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4080590/49893d7